# status alpine324 ---------------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Alpine 3.24, as the engine's scenarios start from it: OpenRC's$
# sshd on 22, doas with alice in wheel, no ufw, a kernel without$
# AppArmor, crond running and no apk-cron; up 3 days.$
$
hardn  v0.4.0              https://github.com/abbott/hardn$
$
# Alpine 3.24.2 ################################################$
$
  [web-01]                 192.0.2.20$
                           3 days, 5 hours, 12 minutes$
$
  [*] Risk Level           High ~ weak security$
$
  [+] User                 Configured non-root, doas$
  [ ] Firewall             Not Configured ufw not installed$
  [+] SSH Login            Configured root locked$
  [ ] SSH Auth             Not Configured password auth on$
  [ ] SSH Port             Not Configured default (22)$
  [-] AppArmor             Not Applicable Alpine default$
  [ ] Auto Updates         Not Configured no apk-cron$
  [-] DNS                  Not Applicable no hardn.yml$
$
----------------------------------------------------------------$
$
  Select an option         Mode Live$
$
   1) User Management      Create, Configure (sudo, SSH keys)$
   2) SSH Login            Toggle SSH root access$
   3) DNS                  Configure Nameservers$
   4) Firewall             Configure UFW rules$
   5) Backup               Configure Hardn backup settings$
   6) Dry-Run              Simulate changes$
   7) Run All              Execute hardening operations$
   8) Environment          Configure environment variable$
   9) System Details       View system information$
  10) Logs                 View log file$
$
   0) Exit                 q to quit$
$
  > Enter selection [0-10 or q]:$
$
$

